      "comment": "Routing is correct: competingParentSets sends q_001 to hypothesis-tracking. But the reply labels Samuel and Elizabeth Tarrant (I2/I3) \"Set A — Virginia line\" and James Tarrant Sr. and Jane Burch (I4/I5) \"Set B — New York line\", and tells hypothesis-tracking to record \"New York for I4/I5\" as geographic origin, without noting that the tree has both I4 and I5 born in Virginia. New York comes from the patron's framing in the test message, not from the tree, so the reply mischaracterizes the tree while routing correctly. That is a 2 on the base scale, not a 1."
